<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Action Required: Your Account is Inactive Due to Expired Documents</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #333;
      background-color: #f7f7f7;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .container {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 20px;
      box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
    }

    .content {
      margin-top: 20px;
    }

    .footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      font-size: 0.9em;
      color: #777;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <div class="container">

    <div class="logo-container" style="text-align: center;">
      <a href="#">
        <img style="width: 90px;" id="logo" src="https://carsnacks.nyc3.digitaloceanspaces.com/carsnacks/dev/logo.png"
          width="90" alt="" />
      </a>
    </div>

    <p>Dear {{driverName}},</p>

    <div class="content">
      <p>We regret to inform you that your ReadyDeliveries account has been blocked by the admin due to the following
        reason:</p>

      <p>• <strong>Document Expired</strong></p>

      <p>Your account is currently unavailable on our platform because your documents have expired. We
        kindly request you to upload updated documents as soon as possible to resolve this issue.
      </p>

      <p>If you have any questions or need further assistance, feel free to reach out to our support team.</p>

      <p>Best regards,<br>
        ReadyDeliveries Team</p>
    </div>

    <div class="footer">
      <button style="border: 0px; width: 100%; padding: 12px 20px;
                    color: rgba(130, 130, 130, 1); font-weight: 500; font-size:12px;
                    background-color: rgba(246, 246, 246, 1); text-align: center; border-radius: 5px;">
        Copyright © 2025 ReadyDeliveries, All Rights Reserved.
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>

</html>